  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Stryker has assessed all products for the Apache open source logging library developed by the Apache Software Foundation. The Stryker Product Security team has taken precautions to secure our products from this new vulnerability. No Stryker products have been identified to utilize affected versions of the java library.</p>\n<p>A thorough evaluation of all potentially impacted products has been conducted. We are not aware of any impact to our products or systems.</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Further information can be found here:</span><br>\n<a href=\"https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2021-44228\">CVE-2021-44228</a></p>\n<p>If further analysis identifies impacted products, we will update the web notification and will follow with direct customer communication from the applicable Stryker division.<br>\n</p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jan 05 2022 15:37:03 GMT+0000",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
    "textIsRich": "true"
  },
